Begin3
Title:          UHDD
Description:    Hard disk/SSD caching driver
Summary:        UHDD is a hard disk/SSD caching driver for up to 10 BIOS disks on up to 4 UltraDMA controllers. It will also provide caching to disks handled by UDVD2, if it is loaded after UHDD.
Keywords:       cache, disk, dma, driver, ide, sata, ultradma
End
